  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, white vinegar, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cut vegetables to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated vegetables onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the grill with butter to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally, until the vegetables are tender and lightly charred.",
    "Remove the skewers from the grill and sprinkle with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
